                            "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0,
                            "playtime_at_review": 33,
                            "last_played": 1589733648
                        },
                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Remake of a classic - you work in a western styled bank, take money from nice customers and shoot the baddies. And like the original it's pretty fun. There is enough variety around the characters and it's not always clear who is good and who came to shoot you or steal from the bank. There are also some minigames like classic bottle shooting.\nThis was first of few small annoyances in the game - aiming to shoot the bottles felt weird to me, like there was some kind of lag. Then there's throwing the money bag into window - I found it pretty difficult to hit it and most of the time the bag ended up on ground and no chance to do something about it. And the animations when starting level look good, but it would be nice if I could speed them up.\nI also kind of wish I could walk around the town as it looked pretty nice from the promo video.\nTLDR: Pretty fun shooting game",
                        "timestamp_created": 1530967756,
